#[=======================================================================[.rst:
RBLXBuildParseArguments
-------------------

.. deprecated:: 3.5

This module once implemented the :command:`rblxbuild_parse_arguments` command
that is now implemented natively by RBLXBuild.  It is now an empty placeholder
for compatibility with projects that include it to get the command from
RBLXBuild 3.4 and lower.
#]=======================================================================]
